---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Leadership Community | Zeta"
  description="Meet Shane Villasor Perez and the leaders shaping Zeta's leadership community through mentorship, professional development, and purposeful leadership."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Leadership Community</p>

      <h1>Developing Leaders Who Inspire Growth</h1>

      <p>
        The Leadership Community highlights the professional journeys of
        Shane Villasor Perez and other recognized leaders who exemplify
        Zeta's values of mentorship, continuous development, and purposeful
        leadership. Their experiences reflect a commitment to professional
        excellence, responsible leadership, and helping others grow within a
        supportive and collaborative community.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Branch Leadership -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell feature-grid">

      <img
        class="rounded-image leadership-portrait"
        src="/images/shane-perez-portrait.png"
        alt="Professional portrait of Shane Villasor Perez"
        width="672"
        height="867"
      />

      <div>

        <p class="eyebrow">Branch Leadership</p>

        <h2>Shane Villasor Perez</h2>

        <p class="section-intro">
          Branch Head, Manulife Philippines • Leader of the Zeta Leadership Community
        </p>

        <p>
          Shane Villasor Perez is a Branch Head at Manulife Philippines and
          the leader of the Zeta Leadership Community. With more than 13
          years of professional experience in client service and leadership,
          she is committed to developing professionals, mentoring future
          leaders, and building organizations that create lasting impact
          through service, integrity, and continuous growth.
        </p>

        <p>
          Before entering the financial services industry, Shane built a
          strong foundation in client relationship management and
          professional excellence as a Professional Service Representative
          at United Laboratories (Unilab). This experience strengthened her
          commitment to delivering exceptional service, building meaningful
          relationships, and maintaining high professional standards—principles
          that continue to shape her leadership today.
        </p>

        <p>
          In 2018, she began her journey with Manulife Philippines as a
          Financial Advisor. Through consistent learning, dedication, and a
          passion for developing others, she progressed into leadership,
          eventually serving as a Unit Head, mentoring and developing
          multiple Unit Heads and Senior Unit Heads before being appointed
          Branch Head in July 2020.
        </p>

        <p>
          A significant influence on her leadership journey has been her
          involvement with GAMA Global. After attending the GAMA LAMP
          Convention in Taiwan, she embraced a philosophy of leadership
          centered on growth, mentorship, and organizational development.
          Since 2019, she has been recognized as a consistent GAMA Awardee
          and has participated in international leadership conventions,
          including Las Vegas (2023) and Denver (2024), while continuing to
          invest in professional development through industry leadership
          programs.
        </p>

        <p>
          Today, Shane leads a leadership community of approximately 40
          leaders, focusing on mentorship, leadership development,
          organizational sustainability, and fostering a collaborative
          culture where professionals are encouraged to grow, serve, and
          develop future leaders.
        </p>

        <hr class="section-divider" />

        <h3>A Philosophy of Building Leaders</h3>

        <blockquote>
          Great leadership is measured not only by personal success, but by
          the ability to develop leaders who inspire, mentor, and create
          opportunities for others.
        </blockquote>

        <p>
          Rather than focusing solely on organizational growth, Shane is
          committed to cultivating capable professionals who lead with
          integrity, empower their teams, and contribute to a culture of
          continuous learning and meaningful service.
        </p>

        <hr class="section-divider" />

        <h3>Leadership Through Resilience</h3>

        <p>
          Shane's journey also reflects resilience and the importance of
          community. Throughout the challenges of the COVID-19 pandemic and
          personal health experiences, the relationships she built through
          her team and leadership community became a source of encouragement,
          strength, and support.
        </p>

        <p>
          These experiences reinforced her belief that strong organizations
          are built not only through performance, but through genuine care,
          mentorship, and people who grow together.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
